msgid "Walk through the [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) guide to see [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") and [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") used together to sample circuits built from this package’s gates, and to evaluate a Hamiltonian expectation value through [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (itself backed by the same `_linear_operator_` protocol method described here).\n"
msgstr "Recorre la guía de [SKQD](skqd#skqd-getting-started) para ver cómo se usan juntas [`ffsim.apply_unitary()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.apply_unitary.html#ffsim.apply_unitary \"(in ffsim)\") y [`ffsim.sample_state_vector()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.sample_state_vector.html#ffsim.sample_state_vector \"(in ffsim)\") para muestrear circuitos construidos con las puertas de este paquete, y para evaluar un valor esperado de un hamiltoniano mediante [`ffsim.linear_operator()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.linear_operator.html#ffsim.linear_operator \"(in ffsim)\") (respaldado a su vez por el mismo método de protocolo `_linear_operator_` descrito aquí).\n"

